{
  "ezekiel.34.p1.b1": {
    "text": "わざわいなるかな、自分自身を養うイスラエルの牧者。牧者は群れを養うべき者ではないか。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Ezekiel 34:2"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "ezekiel.34.p1.b2": {
    "text": "あなたがたは脂肪を食べ、毛織物をまとい、肥えたものをほふるが、群れを養わない。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Ezekiel 34:3"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "ezekiel.34.p1.b3": {
    "text": "病んでいる者をいやさず、傷ついた者をつつまず",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Ezekiel 34:4"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "ezekiel.34.p1.b4": {
    "text": "彼らはもろもろの山と、もろもろの高き丘にさまよい……これを捜す者もなく、尋ねる者もない。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Ezekiel 34:6"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "ezekiel.34.p1.b5": {
    "text": "見よ、わたしは、わたしみずからわが羊を尋ねて、これを捜し出す。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Ezekiel 34:11"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "ezekiel.34.p1.b6": {
    "text": "雲と暗やみの日に散った、すべての所からこれを救う。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Ezekiel 34:12"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "ezekiel.34.p1.b7": {
    "text": "わたしは、うせたものを尋ね、迷い出たものを引き返し、傷ついたものを包み、弱ったものを強くし",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Ezekiel 34:16"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "ezekiel.34.p2.b1": {
    "text": "澄んだ水を飲み、その残りを足で濁す",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Ezekiel 34:18"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "ezekiel.34.p2.b2": {
    "text": "見よ、わたしは肥えた羊と、やせた羊との間をさばく。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Ezekiel 34:20"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "ezekiel.34.p2.b3": {
    "text": "わたしは彼らの上にひとりの牧者を立てる。すなわちわがしもべダビデである。彼は彼らを養う。彼は彼らを養い、彼らの牧者となる。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Ezekiel 34:23"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "ezekiel.34.p2.b4": {
    "text": "季節にしたがって雨を降らす。これは祝福の雨となる。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Ezekiel 34:26"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "ezekiel.34.p2.b5": {
    "text": "わたしが彼らのくびきの棒を砕き",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Ezekiel 34:27"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "ezekiel.34.p2.b6": {
    "text": "あなたがたはわが羊、わが牧場の羊である。わたしはあなたがたの神である",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Ezekiel 34:31"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  }
}
